# LoopKit: this repo's gate config is tracked (no webhook, no secrets); see .loopkit/config.env
# The marker below is what tells loopkit-init.sh that the missing
# `.loopkit/config.env` line is a decision and not an omission. Delete the
# marker and the next init will add the line back.
# loopkit:decided .loopkit/config.env — init wrote this line once and will not re-add it. To opt out, delete the line and keep this comment.

# loopkit:decided .loopkit/driver.lock — a live lock, never history
.loopkit/driver.lock
